WEBVTT

00:02:28.579 --> 00:02:31.829
last cruise ship I was on
had a 24-hour pizza station.

00:02:32.704 --> 00:02:35.163
That’s right, 24 hours, like God intended.

00:02:35.246 --> 00:02:36.746
(Laughter)

00:02:36.954 --> 00:02:39.746
And I remember I was going to get pizza,

00:02:39.746 --> 00:02:41.163
it was like in the morning.

00:02:41.204 --> 00:02:42.204
I wasn’t awake.

00:02:42.204 --> 00:02:43.204
I set an alarm.

00:02:43.246 --> 00:02:45.913
(Laughter)

00:02:46.204 --> 00:02:47.413
I’m dedicated.

00:02:47.496 --> 00:02:48.496
(Laughter)

00:02:48.579 --> 00:02:49.579
(Laughs)

00:02:49.663 --> 00:02:51.913
Some of you know exactly
what I’m talking about.

00:02:52.329 --> 00:02:55.746
I see the real foodies in the audience
that know what I’m talking about.

00:02:55.746 --> 00:02:57.163
I go there, I order my pizza.

00:02:57.163 --> 00:02:59.288
The woman behind me goes
to order her pizza,

00:02:59.288 --> 00:03:03.954
and in full volume with full confidence
she says to the person behind the counter,